            {
              "key": "lang",
              "value": "en"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Powers the Remedies tab's Birth Nakshatra card. id is one of the 27 lowercase-hyphenated nakshatra slugs (ashwini ... revati), derived from the Moon's nakshatra.key in the birth chart's meta lookup. Reference data — no birth params needed."
      },
      "response": []
